      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm just really worried about the cost of the doctor and sitting in an ER for hours. it feels like a muscle thing honestly. if i just do some really intense yoga stretches and maybe some heavy pulling movements to loosen up the spine, wouldn't that just release the pressure? i feel like if i can just stretch it out i can fix it myself without all the medical stuff.",
